"startedSeq":1796,"endedSeq":1845,"startedAt":"1788551978Z","endedAt":"1788552091Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":1796,"activityEndSeq":1845,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0575e71a236f8beb016a9b236e1dc887d0ba4077fdb6602421","seq":1924,"timestamp":"1788552091Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","content":"协议输出实现改为更小且可证明的边界：不增加第二 writer queue，而是在 wrapper 中将**所有** handler response 转成显式 `sendMessage`，并在同一锁内完成“精确预留 → 官方 delegate sink enqueue”。这样官方 sink 的所有入口只有一个、顺序确定；reservation 直到下游 frame flush 才释放。","startedSeq":1846,"endedSeq":1924,"startedAt":"1788552091Z","endedAt":"1788552091Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1520,"revision":1924,"observedAt":"1788552091Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788550571Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788552091Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788550571,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788552091,"revision":1924,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0575e71a236f8beb016a9b236e1dc887d0ba4077fdb6602421","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-1925","seq":1925,"timestamp":"1788552091Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":1925,"endedSeq":1963,"startedAt":"1788552091Z","endedAt":"1788552141Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":1925,"activityEndSeq":1963,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0b29c2a2ace763a2016a9b23c0908887d088f533d43a05279e","seq":2050,"timestamp":"1788552141Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","content":"定向测试全绿。现在补最后两个可审计证据：直接对 transport 的主动 notification 路径施加 257-frame 慢读端，证明第 257 条在官方 sink 前得到结构化 slow-consumer；再通过真实 request handler 快速产生 257 个 response，证明 response 路径使用同一 admission。测试会使用生产固定 256 frame，而非缩小测试阈值。","startedSeq":1964,"endedSeq":2050,"startedAt":"1788552141Z","endedAt":"1788552142Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1571,"revision":2050,"observedAt":"1788552142Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788550571Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788552142Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788550571,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788552142,"revision":2050,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0b29c2a2ace763a2016a9b23c0908887d088f533d43a05279e","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-2051","seq":2051,"timestamp":"1788552142Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":2051,"endedSeq":2067,"startedAt":"1788552142Z","endedAt":"1788552203Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":2051,"activityEndSeq":2067,"totalEventCount":3,"toolCallCount":2,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0f89b3265b3e4c04016a9b23fe1eec87d089f4c2803bfbccbd","seq":2149,"timestamp":"1788552203Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","content":"两个失败都在测试观察层：主动 notification 的生产异常被 Reactor 包装；handler 测试用有限 `ByteArrayInputStream` 立即 EOF，官方 transport 在异步 handler 全部排队前关闭 outbound。改为保持输入端存活的 pipe，等待第 257 个 response 触发 start 链错误，并统一解包根因；不改变生产逻辑。","startedSeq":2068,"endedSeq":2149,"startedAt":"1788552203Z","endedAt":"1788552203Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1632,"revision":2149,"observedAt":"178855220